From e2b6057d1584832ea8b05ce7103d0ec3654db863 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Valentin SAMSON <BEAVSN@BEA.local>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 20:02:25 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] Present in Mailbox mode with vsync when the game paces
 itself

Super Mario Sunshine paces its frames on its own retrace clock. With a FIFO
swapchain each frame also waited for the display, and the two clocks beat:
up to a third of the frames missed a retrace. set_prefer_mailbox() makes
vsync pick Mailbox when the surface offers it (still no tearing, no wait).
The surface's present modes are now logged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
